3,0,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
4,0,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so nervous but excited to play this with you all. Let's all try our best to find the werewolf and keep the village safe! Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start?,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not really sure. Maybe we should just listen to each other for a bit? I don't want to make a mistake and accuse someone who is innocent...,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Daisuke. Since we have no information yet, rushing into accusations is illogical. We should observe everyone's behavior and communication patterns during these first few turns to identify any inconsistencies.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let's keep our hearts calm and be kind to one another. I think Asuka's suggestion to observe is very wise. We shall find the truth together, slowly and surely.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. Let's keep things peaceful and observe for now. I'm a bit nervous too, but I believe that if we support each other, we can figure this out together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's true! Since we're all in agreement, maybe we can talk about our roles in a general way? Or maybe the Seer wants to tell us if they've found anything? Oh, wait, it's only Day 0!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,Right... it's only Day 0. The Seer hasn't had a chance to divine anyone yet. I... I think we should just keep talking normally so we can get a feel for how everyone speaks.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. Establishing a baseline for everyone's typical speech patterns is the most efficient use of our time right now. If someone's tone or logic shifts abruptly tomorrow, it will be much easier to spot.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are quite right, Asuka. It is like watching the seasons change; one must know the usual colors to notice when something is out of place. I shall listen closely to all of you with a warm heart.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think that's a wonderful way to put it, Shizue-san. I'll do my best to be attentive as well. Since we're just getting to know each other's rhythms, does anyone have any questions they'd like to ask?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I don't have any specific questions yet, but I'm curious! @Daisuke, you seem a bit worried. Is there anything on your mind, or are you just feeling the pressure of the game?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... I'm just... I'm not very good at this. I'm afraid I'll say something wrong or get confused. I just want everyone to be okay, but it's hard to know who to trust.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, anxiety is a natural response, but try to focus on the facts. Trust is not something given; it is built through consistent behavior. For now, just speak your mind as honestly as you can.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, please do not be so hard on yourself, dear. We are all here to support you. Just speak from your heart at your own pace; your kindness is already a wonderful contribution to our group.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't worry. We're all in this together, and your honesty is very helpful. I'm here to support you too, so just take a deep breath and relax. We'll figure this out as a team.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Thank you everyone for being so kind to Daisuke! It makes me feel even more positive about our team. I'll keep observing everyone carefully too. I'm looking forward to seeing what happens tomorrow!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... everyone. I feel a little better now that you've all been so nice to me. I'll try my best to be helpful tomorrow. Good luck to all of us.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will also do my best. Let us remain vigilant and objective. I look forward to analyzing the information we gather tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Good night, everyone. May you all have peaceful dreams and wake up refreshed. I shall be praying for the safety of our village. Sleep well, my dear friends.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. Let's all get some rest so we can think clearly tomorrow. I'm glad we could start on such a supportive note. Sleep well, and I'll see you all in the morning.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Yumi,Asuka,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Asuka""}"
