27,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
28,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
29,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
30,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I have some very important information to share... I'm the Seer, and I divined Asuka last night. It turns out Asuka is the werewolf!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,@Yumi... really? Asuka is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. She seemed so calm and logical. Are you absolutely sure? I don't want to vote for the wrong person...,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, that is a bold claim to make so early. There is no evidence other than your word. Are you truly the Seer, or are you the Werewolf attempting to frame me to secure an early win?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, thank you for your courage in speaking up so quickly. @Asuka, please try to stay calm. It is a shocking revelation, but we must listen to Yumi-san with an open mind.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, thank you for telling us so quickly. It's a huge shock, but if you're the Seer, this is the most important lead we have. @Asuka, I understand why you're defensive, but we have to consider Yumi's information.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm definitely the Seer! I'm not trying to frame you; I'm just telling you what I saw. I know it's a shock, but I'm sure about it! Please, everyone, we have to trust the divination!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... if you're really the Seer, then we have to believe you. But @Asuka is so logical... it's hard. I... I think we should trust Yumi, but I'm still so scared of making a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is understandable, but logic dictates that a fake Seer would likely target someone less likely to be defended. I am a clear target because of my directness. @Yumi, your eagerness is suspiciously high. Why reveal yourself so immediately?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, it is natural to feel targeted when such a claim is made. However, @Yumi's eagerness may simply be her desire to protect us all. Let us consider if her honesty is a gift to the village.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, while your logic is sound, the Seer's goal is to protect the village. If Yumi-san found the werewolf on the first night, it would be most logical to tell us immediately to save lives. I'm inclined to trust her.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I revealed myself immediately because I didn't want anyone else to get hurt! If I waited, the werewolf would just attack more people. I'm doing this because I care about all of you! Please, let's vote for Asuka!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... I see. You're doing this to protect us. I... I think I trust you. @Asuka, I'm sorry, but if Yumi is telling the truth, we have to act now to save the village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your emotional response is clouding your judgment. @Yumi, your ""care"" is a convenient mask for a Werewolf's aggression. If you execute me, and I am innocent, you have just handed the victory to the real wolf. Think critically.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, your words are sharp, but they come from a place of fear. @Yumi, your heart is beating fast for our sake. It is a difficult choice, but I believe in Yumi-san's sincerity.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, your arguments are logical, but they don't outweigh the risk of ignoring a Seer's lead. If Yumi-san is lying, she's taking a huge risk by revealing herself so early. I believe we should trust her.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, everyone, for believing in me! I know it's a scary decision, but I'm absolutely certain about what I saw. Let's protect our village together and vote for Asuka!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll do it. I'm still scared, but I can't let more people get hurt because I was too hesitant. @Yumi, I'm trusting you. I'll vote for Asuka. I'm sorry, Asuka... I really am.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your apology is irrelevant if you are sacrificing an innocent based on a whim. @Yumi, your performance is convincing, but logic remains. If I am executed and the wolf remains, my death is your victory. I maintain my innocence.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden to decide someone's fate, but we must trust the light Yumi-san has shown us. My heart tells me she is being honest. I shall vote for Asuka, for the sake of our peace.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. It's a heartbreaking decision, but we can't ignore the Seer's divination. If we don't act now, we risk losing more friends. I'll vote for Asuka as well. I'm sorry, Asuka.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
